---
import "../styles/design-system.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-NZ">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="West Auckland Storage extracted design system." />
    <title>West Auckland Storage · Design system</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="ds-shell">
      <header class="ds-topbar">
        <div class="ds-container ds-topbar-inner">
          <a class="ds-brand" href="/" aria-label="Back to West Auckland Storage">
            <span class="ds-brand-mark">W<br />A</span>
            <span class="ds-brand-name">West Auckland<br />Storage <small>Design system</small></span>
          </a>
          <div class="ds-topbar-meta">Extracted from the working yard site<br />Version 1 · September 2026</div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main>
        <section class="ds-hero">
          <div class="ds-container">
            <p class="ds-eyebrow ds-eyebrow-light">Brand foundation</p>
            <h1>Keep it close.<br /><em>Keep it sorted.</em></h1>
            <p>A practical visual language for a real West Auckland boat yard: sturdy, maritime, local, and straightforward.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="ds-section">
          <div class="ds-container">
            <div class="ds-section-heading">
              <div>
                <p class="ds-eyebrow">01 · Color</p>
                <h2>Working<br /><span>blues.</span></h2>
              </div>
              <p>Keep the palette restricted to open-water blues and quiet neutrals. No decorative golds, greens, or luxury-marina colors.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ds-grid ds-grid-4">
              <article class="ds-swatch">
                <div class="ds-swatch-color" style="background:#145693"></div>
                <div class="ds-swatch-copy"><p class="ds-swatch-name">Deep marine</p><p class="ds-swatch-value">#145693</p></div>
              </article>
              <article class="ds-swatch">
                <div class="ds-swatch-color" style="background:#128BFB"></div>
                <div class="ds-swatch-copy"><p class="ds-swatch-name">Working blue</p><p class="ds-swatch-value">#128BFB</p></div>
              </article>
              <article class="ds-swatch">
                <div class="ds-swatch-color" style="background:#A5D2FD"></div>
                <div class="ds-swatch-copy"><p class="ds-swatch-name">Sky blue</p><p class="ds-swatch-value">#A5D2FD</p></div>
              </article>
              <article class="ds-swatch">
                <div class="ds-swatch-color" style="background:#082E54"></div>
                <div class="ds-swatch-copy"><p class="ds-swatch-name">Deep water</p><p class="ds-swatch-value">#082E54</p></div>
              </article>
              <article class="ds-swatch">
                <div class="ds-swatch-color" style="background:#12283D"></div>
                <div class="ds-swatch-copy"><p class="ds-swatch-name">Ink</p><p class="ds-swatch-value">#12283D</p></div>
              </article>
              <article class="ds-swatch">
                <div class="ds-swatch-color" style="background:#587086"></div>
                <div class="ds-swatch-copy"><p class="ds-swatch-name">Muted</p><p class="ds-swatch-value">#587086</p></div>
              </article>
              <article class="ds-swatch">
                <div class="ds-swatch-color" style="background:#F5F8FA"></div>
                <div class="ds-swatch-copy"><p class="ds-swatch-name">Paper</p><p class="ds-swatch-value">#F5F8FA</p></div>
              </article>
              <article class="ds-swatch">
                <div class="ds-swatch-color" style="background:#D3E1EB"></div>
                <div class="ds-swatch-copy"><p class="ds-swatch-name">Line</p><p class="ds-swatch-value">#D3E1EB</p></div>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="ds-section">
          <div class="ds-container">
            <div class="ds-section-heading">
              <div>
                <p class="ds-eyebrow">02 · Type</p>
                <h2>Big enough<br /><span>to read.</span></h2>
              </div>
              <p>Condensed display type carries the industrial wordmark. DM Sans keeps every quote, form, and instruction easy to use.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ds-grid ds-grid-2">
              <article class="ds-type-card">
                <p class="ds-type-display">Keep it<br />sorted.</p>
                <h3>Barlow Condensed</h3>
                <p class="ds-type-meta">Display · headings · numeric marks · uppercase labels</p>
              </article>
              <article class="ds-type-card">
                <p class="ds-type-body">Secure outdoor storage for boats, caravans, trailers and gear — right here in West Auckland.</p>
                <h3>DM Sans</h3>
                <p class="ds-type-meta">Body · navigation · controls · supporting copy</p>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="ds-section">
          <div class="ds-container">
            <div class="ds-section-heading">
              <div>
                <p class="ds-eyebrow">03 · Components</p>
                <h2>No fuss.<br /><span>Just useful.</span></h2>
              </div>
              <p>Controls are square-edged, high contrast, and direct. The action should be obvious without looking corporate.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ds-grid ds-grid-2">
              <article class="ds-component-card">
                <h3>Actions and links</h3>
                <p>Use one clear primary action, then quieter directional links for everything else.</p>
                <div class="ds-button-row" style="margin-top:24px">
                  <a class="ds-button ds-button-primary" href="/contact/">Get a quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                  <a class="ds-button ds-button-outline" href="/services/">What we store <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                </div>
                <div class="ds-link-row" style="margin-top:20px">
                  <a class="ds-link" href="/about/">See why people use us <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                </div>
              </article>
              <article class="ds-component-card">
                <h3>Quote form controls</h3>
                <p>Labels stay plain and inputs keep the focus state visible.</p>
                <div class="ds-control-stack" style="margin-top:20px">
                  <label class="ds-control">Your name<input placeholder="Jeff or Andrew" /></label>
                  <label class="ds-control">What are you storing?<select><option>Choose one</option><option>Boat</option><option>Caravan</option></select></label>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>
            <div class="ds-dark-panel" style="margin-top:20px">
              <div class="ds-grid ds-grid-2">
                <article class="ds-component-card">
                  <h3>On dark surfaces</h3>
                  <p>Use sky blue for supporting emphasis and the bright blue for the action.</p>
                  <div class="ds-button-row" style="margin-top:22px">
                    <a class="ds-button ds-button-primary" href="/contact/">Talk to the yard <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                    <a class="ds-button ds-button-dark" href="/about/">Why us</a>
                  </div>
                </article>
                <article class="ds-component-card">
                  <h3>Information markers</h3>
                  <p class="ds-metric" style="margin:20px 0 0;color:#A5D2FD;font-size:58px;line-height:.8">15+</p>
                  <p style="margin-top:12px">years serving local owners</p>
                </article>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="ds-section">
          <div class="ds-container">
            <div class="ds-section-heading">
              <div>
                <p class="ds-eyebrow">04 · Voice</p>
                <h2>Say it<br /><span>straight.</span></h2>
              </div>
              <p>Design and copy work together. The yard should feel like it is run by people who know what they are storing.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ds-grid ds-grid-2">
              <article class="ds-voice-card">
                <strong>Prefer</strong>
                <ul>
                  <li>Close to home</li>
                  <li>Secure</li>
                  <li>Straightforward</li>
                  <li>No fuss</li>
                  <li>Your spot</li>
                  <li>Sorted</li>
                </ul>
              </article>
              <article class="ds-voice-card">
                <strong>Avoid</strong>
                <ul>
                  <li>Premium facility</li>
                  <li>World-class</li>
                  <li>Seamless experience</li>
                  <li>Luxury</li>
                  <li>State-of-the-art</li>
                  <li>Unverified security claims</li>
                </ul>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="ds-section">
          <div class="ds-container">
            <div class="ds-section-heading">
              <div>
                <p class="ds-eyebrow">05 · Imagery</p>
                <h2>Show the<br /><span>real place.</span></h2>
              </div>
              <p>Use genuine boats, hardstand, trailers, and the actual yard. Wide practical shots beat polished lifestyle imagery.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ds-grid ds-grid-3">
              <figure class="ds-image-card"><img src="/images/yard-boat.jpg" alt="Boat at the yard" /><figcaption>Working yard</figcaption></figure>
              <figure class="ds-image-card"><img src="/images/boat-hardstand.jpg" alt="Boat on hardstand" /><figcaption>Outdoor hardstand</figcaption></figure>
              <figure class="ds-image-card"><img src="/images/trailer-storage.jpg" alt="Trailer storage" /><figcaption>Room to store</figcaption></figure>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer class="ds-footer">
        <div class="ds-container">
          <p>West Auckland Storage · A real yard. No fuss.</p>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>